{"id": 366023, "artworks": [{"id": 194493, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/ar462l.jpg"}, {"id": 194492, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/ar462k.jpg"}, {"id": 194494, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/ar462m.jpg"}], "external_games": [{"id": 3158503, "name": "Yakouga 7", "uid": "108631233", "url": "https://www.twitch.tv/directory/game/Yakouga%207", "external_game_source": {"id": 14, "name": "Twitch"}}], "game_modes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Single player"}], "involved_companies": [{"id": 344405, "company": {"id": 44158, "name": "Akiragoya"}, "developer": true}], "name": "Yakouga 7", "platforms": [6], "player_perspectives": [{"id": 4, "name": "Side view"}], "release_dates": [{"id": 798233, "date": 1419984000, "platform": 6, "y": 2014, "release_region": {"id": 5, "region": "japan"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1633264, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scz08g.jpg"}, {"id": 1633263, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scz08f.jpg"}, {"id": 1633265, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scz08h.jpg"}, {"id": 1633266, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scz08i.jpg"}], "slug": "yakouga-7", "summary": "It is an exploratory ARPG.\nSimply collect moves, register them in the [Combo Slot], and hold down the [Combo Button] to perform continuous attacks.\nIn addition to combo moves, there is also a [Slam Move], where you can use the arrow keys + [Slam button] to attack such as launching and flapping.\nAfter the launch move, you can hold \u2191 to make a follow-up jump, make some cool aerial combos.\n\nThere aren't many elements like Yakouga 3 where you collect items and pave the way.\nIt feels like repeating the battle endlessly and increasing the attack rate of each map.\n\nThe story is completely independent and can be enjoyed without knowing the past works.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/yakouga-7", "videos": [{"id": 161